irector w.e.f. June 01, 2026 for five years, subject to shareholder approval at the ensuing AGM; DIN 11735730","independent":false,"name":"Mr. Rohitashv Sharma"}],"business":"The Company manufactures and sells automotive tyres, namely farm tyres and commercial truck bias tyres, at its Ballabgarh plant. It also markets and sells passenger car tyres manufactured by Goodyear South Asia Tyres Private Limited ('GSATPL'), Aurangabad, in the replacement market, along with tubes and flaps. It serves both the Farm OE channel (tractor manufacturers) and the Farm and Consumer replacement channels, with the farm tyre business positioned as its leadership franchise.","certs":"ISO 9001 - Quality Management System (recertified in 2024)|ISO 14001 - Environmental Management System (recertified in 2023)|Systems and procedures based on the Goodyear global Quality Management System","co":"GOODYEAR INDIA LIMITED","depth":"deep","end_markets":"Farm OE (tractor original equipment manufacturers)|Farm replacement market in India|Consumer / passenger car replacement market in India|Commercial truck (bias) tyres|Export market for tractor farm tyres","expansion":"The routed sections disclose no new plant, line or capacity-expansion project with a commissioning or ramp timeline. Manufacturing remains concentrated at the Ballabgarh plant (farm tyres and commercial truck bias tyres), while passenger car tyres sold in the replacement market are manufactured by Goodyear South Asia Tyres Private Limited ('GSATPL'), Aurangabad. The principal expansion thrust is commercial rather than physical: after The Goodyear Tire & Rubber Company communicated in April 2025 its intention to undertake a strategic review of the Company's farm tire business and then …","grades":{"rel":0,"s":"","wm90":null},"industry":"Auto Components","isin":"INE533A01012","kpi":null,"listed_on":"","litigation":{"_nulled":"P0 2026-08-08 — unevidenced verdict removed (prompt-seeded default)","material":null,"note":"Not determinable fr